// Names are semantic -- `Hierarchy`, `SceneView`, `Inspector` -- rather than
// `Col` or `Row`, because a name is how the code above asks for a rect. An
// unknown name is a transparent container that hands its whole rect to its
// children, which is exactly what a named region wants to be.

